.TH WLIST 1 "17 November 2026" "version 0.3.0"
.SH NAME
wlist \- simple CLI wishlist creator.
.SH SYNOPSIS
wlist <Command>...
.SH DESCRIPTION
wlist is a program that can be used 
to generate a wishlist that can be given to anyone.
.PP
Each operation is performed by a subcommand, as such:
.RS
.IP
adding an item.
.IP
updating an item.
.IP
removing an item.
.IP
importing items.
.IP
exporting the registry.
.IP
displaying the registry 
and item details.
.RE
.SH OPTIONS

As this program relies on using subcommands, there are no real options.

However, for basic things, like information, the following are available:

.TP
.B -h, --help
Displays help.
.TP
.B -V, --version
Display version number.
.SH AUTHOR
Bryce Campbell (tonyhawk2100@gmail.com)
.SH SEE ALSO
wlist-add(1),
wlist-export(1),
wlist-import(1),
wlist-show(1),
wlist-delete(1),
wlist-update(1)